<title>THAILAND: Thai Sept trade deficit narrows to 25 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai Sept trade deficit narrows to 25 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand said on Thursday Thailand's September trade deficit narrowed to 25.0 billion baht from 36.8 billion in August and against 11.7 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>    MERCHANDISE TRADE    Sept 96     Aug 96	Sept 95</p>
<p>	  Exports	     112.5	117.7	  126.2</p>
<p>	  Imports	     137.5	154.5	  137.9</p>
<p>	  Trade balance     -25.0	-36.8	  -11.7</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
